Author: bryaninjapan <paperworkbybryan@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Sep 2 02:28:37 2026 +0900

    revise(phase-14): fix all 6 warnings from 2nd plan-check
    
    - W1: Correct hardcoded-string grep pattern to lowercase (btc_* not BTC_*), add public/index.html audit
    - W2: Fix db.ts migration targets — only Timestamp.now() sites need migration, not start/end params
    - W3: Clarify admin.ts line 38 semantics — do NOT apply msToSec to ms probe value
