    - W5: Mark 4/8 modules as audit-only (likely no-op), clarify genuine conversion sites
    - W6: Improve divergence refactor example to use named constants not array indices, fix lowercase
    - I1: Correct test count reference from 44 to actual 36
    
    Plan now ready for execution with all warnings addressed.

